Improve element selection to reduce false matches:

1. Restrict candidates to:
   - button, a, input, select, textarea
   - elements with role="button" or onclick
   - remove generic div/span unless explicitly clickable

2. Add text matching priority:
   - exact match first
   - startsWith next
   - contains last

3. Reject noisy elements:
   - text length > 40 characters
   - width/height < 20px
   - not visible

4. Add simple position scoring:
   - prefer elements in top half of viewport

5. Add keyword-based hints:
   - "dropdown" → prefer select/button with aria-haspopup
   - "link" → prefer <a>
   - "field" → prefer input/textarea

Goal:
Reduce matches from 10+ to 1–2 in most cases and improve auto-selection accuracy.
